SAFETY LIMITATION

This software models industrial plant. It is at prototype stage. It has never
been validated against an operating plant, it carries no corrosion model, and
approximately 40 % of a Gulf year lies outside the conditions its validation
data covers.

It must not be used to control real equipment, to set operating limits for real
equipment, or to make safety decisions about real equipment.
